# The feel clips of one class (docs/design/feel.md, F1): three seconds each
# of a basic hit, a critical hit and a kill, on the dummies of the feel
# yard. Run by tools/feel/run.sh, which sets CLASS and STAND (how far from
# a dummy the class fights) and makes the contact strips.
#
# Each clip begins before the blow: the right click (auto-attack) and the
# first ability key are inside it.

say /feel
wait 3
say /time noon
wait 1

# --- a basic hit: the Training Dummy ------------------------------------------
walk-to creature training_dummy STAND
look-at creature training_dummy
orbit 35
wait 2.0
clip-start CLASS-hit
click right creature training_dummy
key 1
wait 2.8
clip-end
expect attacking

# --- a critical hit: every blow on the Keen Dummy is one ----------------------
orbit 0
walk-to creature keen_dummy STAND
look-at creature keen_dummy
orbit 35
wait 2.0
clip-start CLASS-crit
click right creature keen_dummy
key 1
wait 2.8
clip-end

# --- a kill: the Straw Dummy falls to any blow --------------------------------
orbit 0
walk-to creature straw_dummy STAND
look-at creature straw_dummy
orbit 35
wait 2.0
clip-start CLASS-kill
click right creature straw_dummy
key 1
wait 2.8
clip-end
